    "body": "The routing wrapper accepts --top-k but omits it from the concentration subprocess, leaving older traces without router top-k comparisons. Forward the explicit override to that analysis.\n\nValidation: focused CPU regression executes the actual wrapper and concentration subprocess against real JSONL; fails on baseline and passes fixed. The independent GPU predictability subprocess is skipped. isort, Black and Ruff pass for the regression file; no GPU suite was run.\n\nReview requested: @NVIDIA/mcore-oncall. This PR is ready for review with CPU regression evidence above. Upstream runner validation remains subject to NVIDIA contributor vetting.\n",
    "changed_files": 2,
